  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mOV5RKV.png\" alt=\"Banner\" width=\"572\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<p>此模組允許玩家重置村民的交易。模組會在村民交易介面中新增一個重置按鈕，用於重新洗練交易內容。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請注意，您只能重置尚未獲得經驗值的村民交易。若村民曾與玩家交易過，便會累積經驗值，此時重置按鈕將不會顯示！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>若在伺服器上遊玩，必須在伺服器端也安裝此模組！</strong></span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz Partner\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要伺服器嗎？使用優惠碼「mrbysco」即可享受首月八折優惠！</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如有任何問題，歡迎隨時加入我的 Discord。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord Link\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;<strong>想要支持我們嗎？</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -ShyNieke</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
